   "source": [
    "## What is a Stack?\n",
    "#### 1. A linear data structure, that stores elements in a sequential order.\n",
    "#### 2. Insertion and deletion happens only on one end called 'top' of the stack.\n",
    "#### 3. Stacks follow a Last In First Out (LIFO) principle."
   ]
